- Yeah, no, no.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:29.913
- Yeah, okay.

00:09:29.913 --> 00:09:30.746
And where was...

00:09:30.746 --> 00:09:31.790
Is this in Kentucky?

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:33.640
- Tennessee.
- Tennessee, hard to believe.

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:34.761
- Yeah, who knew?

00:09:34.761 --> 00:09:35.600
